", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M_UnLUPxggsQ7kNvwGKzwlQ&_nc_oc=Adp-sBUkR1iOsGqe_aGDG7c_wWRfuAoqPf0ZDXbgVmhuD67zSHtb2bq2cSziONmarB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0ELW5jFSpsxDGTxkj_VTprVFdCSc6RoDNO0qxmwqxUFA&oe=69F4ACF9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UgJaTkYfGacQ7kNvwE5IdSB&_nc_oc=AdoCqrhgnCUk8pks88hzg3Ig4UOCs6m79ViCgtjpz2H8rA6SkrHVk9SsKYZ0hqwoa0M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2JOFcmHwkSi5BT-81x0B0nHGZ-HC9EU_KEwDc5n1EZ7A&oe=69F4C3CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=93g0k_A67ToQ7kNvwF6Zv03&_nc_oc=AdrLm86GUJS4nH_-Bu7JJB6VOuUSAbpiYKSTKszYjybKjwk_60kfA1B6JaAd8zorROg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0Z-a3F6yES2DF4J8ER6D6Y7yITNSdOkGLecr8c2zcnew&oe=69F4C24E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel